OL,3,ANepal rescuers try to reach dozens
OL,4,Atrapped in tunnel after two found alive
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe massive flash flood, believed to
OL,7,Fhave been triggered by a glacial
OL,8,Fcollapse, swept through a Himalayan
OL,9,Fvalley last Wednesday, wiping out
OL,10,Fentire villages.
OL,12,FThere are now 1,311 confirmed dead and
OL,13,F5,330 still missing in Nepal and Tibet.
OL,14,FHundreds of foreign citizens are
OL,15,Fbelieved to be among those missing,
OL,16,Ffrom at least 34 countries.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
